# Subject: area: what changed
#   Areas: desktop, tauri, transcription, voice-ai, agent, pill, bindings,
#   preview, docs, i18n, ci, release, deps, repo. See COMMIT.md.
#   Describe the change, not the activity. 72 characters or less, no full stop.
#
# Body: why the change is needed, and what the old behaviour did wrong.
#   Say what you ran to verify it when the diff does not make that obvious.
#
# Trailers:
#   Closes #N            only with a real issue number
#   Co-authored-by: Real Name <real.email@example.com>
#
# With the default commit.cleanup=strip, git drops these # lines before the message is stored.
